6edition#input-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Target selection</a></h4><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sidekick gives contextual answers when clicking on specific areas of the admin.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"sidekick-remembers-preferences\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-remembers-preferences\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h4 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/shopify-admin/productivity-tools/sidekick/help-and-guidance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Better memory</a></h4><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sidekick remembers your chats and unique user preferences.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"sidekick-creates-companies\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-creates-companies\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h4 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/companies-and-customers/creating-companies?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Quick company creation</a></h4><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sidekick can easily create B2B companies.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"sidekick-manages-money\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-manages-money\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h4 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/shopify-admin/productivity-tools/sidekick/help-and-guidance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#check-balance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Money management</a></h4><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sidekick checks your <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmril1q35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/balance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmril1q35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and can make transfers with your approval.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"sidekick-generates-blocks-for-all-themes\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-generates-blocks-for-all-themes\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h4 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-store/themes/customizing-themes/theme-editor/shopify-magic/generate-blocks?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Block generation for all themes</a></h4><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sidekick can create custom blocks in any theme from the Shopify Theme Store.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"agentic\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"agentic\" data-section-id=\"agentic\" data-section-index=\"1\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-center\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pb-0 global-lg:pt-[14vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Agentic</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:pt-[11vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Sell directly in AI chats with built-in tools that syndicate your products to every AI platform.</p></div></div></div><div id=\"agentic-xxl\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\"><div class=\"lg:pb-80 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen w-[100cqw] global-lg:left-[-20cqw] relative block p-0 z-2 pb-60 md:pb-120 text-light\" data-nav-style=\"solid\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"global-lg:max-w-4/5 global-lg:ml-auto grid-template-with-gaps px-grid-spacing global-lg:pl-0 padded-container:px-0\"><article class=\"w-full col-span-full global-lg:mb-40 grid grid-cols-subgrid remove-parent-y-gap items-center justify-between pt-[15vh] global-lg:pt-100 pb-0! mb-0! pr-0! mr-0! gap-12 [&amp;&gt;div]:pr-0! [&amp;&gt;div]:mr-0!\" id=\"shopify-agentic-storefronts\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-agentic-storefronts\"><div class=\"col-span-full global-lg:col-span-6 col-span-5! global-lg:col-span-5! pb-40\"><h3 id=\"card-heading-shopify-agentic-storefronts\" class=\"mb-15 headline-4 text-light\">Shopify Agentic Storefronts</h3><div class=\"rich-text mb-15 text-pretty text-light narrative-3\"><p>Manage how your brand appears to the millions of users shopping in <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rlll2q35:_ai-chats\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/agentic-storefronts?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">AI chats</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rlll2q35:_ai-chats\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>. Your products are discoverable right in ChatGPT, Copilot, and Perplexity, with other channels coming soon.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opa