name=\"cta-open-video-modal\" data-transition-id=\"agentic-storefronts-video\" class=\"group flex absolute inset-0 items-center justify-center z-10 outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-inset pointer-events-auto\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Play Video</span><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center square-button group-hover:bg-light group-focus-visible:bg-light group-active:bg-light\"><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto square-button-icon group-hover:text-dark group-focus-visible:text-dark group-active:text-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M23.4 11.6536C23.6667 11.8076 23.6667 12.1925 23.4 12.3464L6.6 22.0459C6.33333 22.1999 6 22.0074 6 21.6995L6 2.30051C6 1.99259 6.33333 1.80014 6.6 1.9541L23.4 11.6536Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></div></div></button></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid-padding py-20 flex flex-col pointer-events-none z-10 justify-end\"><h4 id=\"card-heading-agentic-storefronts-video\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width text-light headline-4 pointer-events-auto hidden\">Agentic Storefronts</h4><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-white bodycopy-1 pointer-events-auto\"><p>Set up your data once and Shopify Agentic Storefronts will surface your products to AI chats everywhere.</p></div></div></div></article></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"online\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"online\" data-section-id=\"online\" data-section-index=\"2\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-center\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pb-0 global-lg:pt-[14vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Online</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:pt-[11vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Validate store changes with A/B testing and an AI tool that simulates shopping behavior.</p></div></div></div><div id=\"rollout-xxl\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\"><div class=\"lg:pb-80 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen w-[100cqw] global-lg:left-[-20cqw] relative block p-0 z-2 pb-60 md:pb-120 text-dark\" data-nav-style=\"solid\" data-nav-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"global-lg:max-w-4/5 global-lg:ml-auto grid-template-with-gaps px-grid-spacing global-lg:pl-0 padded-container:px-0\"><article class=\"w-full col-span-full global-lg:mb-40 grid grid-cols-subgrid overflow-visible\" id=\"rollouts\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"rollouts\"><div class=\"col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid overflow-visible\"><div class=\"col-span-full pt-[25vh] grid-template\"><div class=\"col-span-full global-lg:col-span-6\"><h3 id=\"card-heading-rollouts\" class=\"mb-15 headline-4 text-dark !text-dark\">Test and time your launches with Rollouts</h3><div class=\"rich-text mb-15 text-pretty text-dark narrative-3 !text-dark\"><p>Schedule theme changes and A/B test with Rollouts, built directly into the admin.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"n