files/U230_Wordpress.png?v=1765139225&amp;width=300&amp;height=348&amp;crop=center 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U230_Wordpress.png?v=1765139225&amp;width=500&amp;height=580&amp;crop=center 2x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U230_Wordpress.png?v=1765139225&amp;width=700&amp;height=812&amp;crop=center 3x\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:825/957\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-sell-on-wordpress\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Sell on WordPress</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Turn your WordPress site into an online store by adding products, collections, a cart, and checkout with the Shopify plugin.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/sell-on-wordpress?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"over-250-horizon-theme-improvements\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"over-250-horizon-theme-improvements\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://themes.shopify.com/collections/horizon-themes?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Over 250 Horizon theme improvements</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get new animations, interactive sections, faster performance, and more when using Horizon.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"2048-variants-per-product\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"2048-variants-per-product\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/blog/2048-variants?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">2048 variants per product</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Create products with up to 2048 variants to manage and merchandise more diverse catalogs.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"unlisted-product-status\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"unlisted-product-status\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/products/details/product-details-page?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#unlisted-products\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Unlisted product status</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Hide products from search results, collections, and more, while keeping them accessible with a direct URL.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"duplicate-and-exclude-products-from-collections\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"duplicate-and-exclude-products-from-collections\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/products/collections/smart-collections/create?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Collections improvements</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Duplicate collections and exclude products from smart collections using conditional logic.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"automatic-discounts-for-eligible-customers\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"automatic-discounts-for-eligible-customers\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/discounts/managing-discounts?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#manage-discount-eligibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Automatic discounts for eligible customers</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Run targeted promotions by creating automatic discounts that target specific customers, such as VIPs.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"compare-at-prices-in-catalogs\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"compare-at-prices-in-catalogs\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/markets-new/catalogs?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#create-catalog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Compare-at prices in catalogs</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Set up compare-at prices directly in your admin without CSV imports or APIs.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"combine-bundle-options\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"combine-bundle-options\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/products/bundles/shopify-bundles?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#combine-bundle-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Combine bundle options</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Combine options, such as size and length, in the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R1cfp5jq35:_shopify bundles\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shopify-bundles?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Bundles</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R1cfp5jq35:_shopify bundles\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"unit-pricing-available-globally\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"unit-pricing-available-globally\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/products/details/product-pricing/unit-pricing?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Unit pricing for all</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Display prices by weight, volume, length, or quantity in metric, imperial, or counts, now available globally.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"vibe-code-with-lovable\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"vibe-code-with-lovable\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://lovable.dev/shopify?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Vibe code with Lovable</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Spin up a Shopify store using Lovable that includes products, inventory, analytics, checkout, and more.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"ai-powered-domain-discovery\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"ai-powered-domain-discovery\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/domains/add-a-domain/buying-domains?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#buy-domain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">AI-powered domain discovery</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get suggestions for unique and available domain names from AI. English only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"improved-theme-search-and-industry-filters\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"improved-theme-search-and-industry-filters\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://themes.shopify.com/themes?surface_detail=browse_themes_link&amp;surface_type=home&amp;utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Improved theme discovery</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Find a theme with improved search, more precise industry filters, and templates with less manual setup.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"ai-generated-theme-before-signup\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"ai-generated-theme-before-signup\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/tools/ai-store-builder?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">AI-generated theme before signup</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Describe what you want to sell and AI will generate a custom store, even without a Shopify account.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"autofill-passcode-on-ios-26\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"autofill-passcode-on-ios-26\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\">Autofill passcode on iOS 26</h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Customers can sign into their account without leaving the browser using Apple&#x27;s iOS 26 passcode autofill.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"one-tap-sign-in-with-shop\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"one-tap-sign-in-with-shop\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/customers/customer-accounts/new-customer-accounts/manage?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Faster customer login with Shop</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let recognized Shop users sign in to any Shopify store with one tap.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customer-sign-in-with-social-accounts\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customer-sign-in-with-social-accounts\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/customers/customer-accounts/new-customer-accounts/social-sign-in?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customer sign-in with social accounts</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let customers sign in to your store with Google or Facebook.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customers-can-edit-their-email-addresses\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customers-can-edit-their-email-addresses\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/customers/customer-accounts?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customers can edit their email addresses</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Allow customers to change their email addresses themselves in their account using a one-time passcode verification.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customizable-sign-in-copy\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customizable-sign-in-copy\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-store/themes/customizing-themes/language/change-wording?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#change-the-default-wording-in-your-theme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customizable sign-in copy</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Change the text on your customer sign-in and one-time-passcode pages in the theme content editor.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"tinker-xxl\" class=