ursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://hardware.shopify.com/pages/poshub?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Shop now</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></div></article><article class=\"w-full col-span-full safe-min-h-svh global-lg:mb-40\" id=\"connections-that-never-drop\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"connections-that-never-drop\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-165-svh w-full\"><div class=\"sticky top-110 safe-min-h-svh grid-template\"><div class=\"col-span-full global-lg:col-span-6\"><h3 id=\"card-heading-connections-that-never-drop\" class=\"mb-15 headline-4 text-light\">Connections that never drop</h3><div class=\"rich-text mb-15 text-pretty text-light narrative-3\"><p>Plug in card readers, printers, and scanners for the strongest, most reliable connection. No pairing required.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class=\"w-full col-span-full safe-min-h-svh global-lg:mb-40\" id=\"the-only-hub-with-proc