rd-heading-pos-customization-in-one-editor\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">POS customization in one editor</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Customize the customer display, smart grid, receipts, and lock screen in a single editor.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/customize-pos?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 md:col-span-3 sm-tablet:col-span-2 space-y-10\" id=\"same-day-delivery-with-uber-direct\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"same-day-delivery-with-uber-direct\"><div class=\"media-wrapper rela