t=158&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U62_Uber_Direct_POS_local.png?v=1764806213&amp;width=300&amp;height=475&amp;crop=center 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U62_Uber_Direct_POS_local.png?v=1764806213&amp;width=500&amp;height=791&amp;crop=center 2x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U62_Uber_Direct_POS_local.png?v=1764806213&amp;width=700&amp;height=1107&amp;crop=center 3x\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:825/1305\"/></div></div><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1113 / 1113\" class=\"md:hidden\"></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-same-day-delivery-with-uber-direct\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Same-day delivery with Uber Direct</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Offer fast local delivery for online orders with live tracking using Uber Direct on POS. Exclusive to Plus. US, Canada, and France only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/uber-direct?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Get app</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"markets-for-retail\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"markets-for-retail\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/markets/manage?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#catalogs-for-retail-markets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Markets for retail</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Set unique prices and publish products per retail location and online. Exclusive to POS Pro.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"retail-payments-in-more-countries\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"retail-payments-in-more-countries\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/getting-started/setup-payment-method/shopify-payments-pos?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#supported\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Retail payments in more countries</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Accept in-person payments, including Tap to Pay on iPhone and Android, in Luxembourg, Switzerland, and the Czech Republic.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"qr-code-payments\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"qr-code-payments\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/payment-management/accepting-local-payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#supported-local-payment-methods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">QR code payments</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let customers pay in store with iDeal, Swish, Twint, Mobilepay, and USDC by scanning a QR code and completing checkout on their phone.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"tap-to-pay-in-more-countries\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"tap-to-pay-in-more-countries\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/payment-management/tap-to-pay-iphone?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#requirements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Tap to Pay in more countries</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let customers Tap to Pay on iPhone in Germany, Ireland, Spain, and New Zealand.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"cartes-bancaires-accepted-on-pos\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"cartes-bancaires-accepted-on-pos\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/supported-countries/france/payment-methods?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#card-type-france\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Cartes Bancaires accepted on POS</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Accept Cartes Bancaires (CB) branded cards from your POS in France.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"transfers-pos-extension\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"transfers-pos-extension\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/inventory-management/receiving-transfers?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Receive transfer shipments in-store</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Accept or reject transfers in store using the Transfers POS extension. Exclusive to POS Pro.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customizable-return-receipts\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customizable-return-receipts\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/customize-pos/printed-receipts/receipt-code-editor?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customizable return receipts</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Create custom return and exchange receipts with your return policy, logo, and contact information using the Liquid editor.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"in-progress-return-visibility\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"in-progress-return-visibility\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/order-management/complete-refund-orders?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Better in-progress return visibility</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Accurately track in-progress returns in your POS and easily cancel unfulfilled items.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"refund-selections-on-pos\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"refund-selections-on-pos\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/order-management/complete-refund-orders?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#refund-an-order\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Refund selections on POS</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Choose between original payment, gift card, or store credit on a dedicated refund screen.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"marketing\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"marketing\" data-section-id=\"marketing\" data-section-index=\"4\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-center\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pb-0\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Marketing</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:pt-[11vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Grow your sales with a first-of-its-kind product network.</p></div></div></div><div id=\"chatgpt-xxl\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\"><div class=\"lg:pb-80 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen w-[100cqw] global-lg:left-[-20cqw] relative block p-0 z-2 pb-60 md:pb-120 text-light pb-0! [&amp;&gt;div]:pr-0! [&amp;&gt;div]:mr-0!\" data-nav-style=\"solid\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"global-lg:max-w-4/5 global-lg:ml-auto grid-template-with-gaps px-grid-spacing global-lg:pl-0 padded-container:px-0\"><article class=\"w-full col-span-full global-lg:mb-40 md:mt-[25vh] grid grid-cols-subgrid items-center justify-between pt-[15vh] global-lg:pt-100\" id=\"shopify-product-network\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-product-network\"><div class=\"col-span-full global-lg:col-span-6 pb-50 global-lg:pt-0\"><h3 id=\"card-heading-shopify-product-network\" class=\"mb-15 headline-4 text-light\">Shopify Product Network</h3><div class=\"rich-text mb-15 text-pretty text-light narrative-3\"><p>Fill merchandise gaps by choosing to instantly surface products from other Shopify brands in your search, collections, emails, and post-purchase pages, and earn a commission on every sale. US only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled