1269\" class=\"md:hidden\"></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-improved-segmentation-template-search\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Improved segmentation template search</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Browse, search, and filter through a refreshed customer segmentation template library.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/customers/customer-segmentation/create-customer-segments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#template\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"target-all-audiences-in-one-shop-campaign\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"target-all-audiences-in-one-shop-campaign\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/shop-campaigns/understanding-campaigns?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#campaign-objectives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Target all audiences in one Shop Campaign</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Launch a single Shop Campaign for all audiences rather than choosing between acquisition or win back. US and Canada only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shop-campaigns-on-x-snap-and-bing\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shop-campaigns-on-x-snap-and-bing\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/shop-campaigns/understanding-campaigns?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#other-platforms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shop Campaigns on more channels</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get promoted in new ad channels, including X, Snapchat, and Bing, and only pay when customers convert. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"segment-customers-with-product-categories\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"segment-customers-with-product-categories\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/customers/customer-segmentation/create-customer-segments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#shopifyql\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Segment customers with product categories</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Create customer segments based on product categories that they have viewed or purchased.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"improved-email-customer-segmentation\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"improved-email-customer-segmentation\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/shopify-messaging/email/subscriber-list-management?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Improved email customer segmentation</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Strategically target customers with intuitive segment selection and recommendations in the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rm9r5lq35:_shopify messaging\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shopify-messaging?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Messaging</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rm9r5lq35:_shopify messaging\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"dynamic-product-sections-in-emails\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"dynamic-product-sections-in-emails\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/shopify-messaging/email/create-email/templates?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#product\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Dynamic product sections in emails</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Automatically display your best selling products or specific collections when creating emails in the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmbr5lq35:_shopify messaging\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shopify-messaging?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Messaging</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmbr5lq35:_shopify messaging\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"calendar-view-for-messaging\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"calendar-view-for-messaging\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/shopify-messaging/email/create-email/create-campaigns?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#planner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Calendar view for messaging</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Schedule marketing emails and SMS in the planner and create campaigns using the recommendations section in the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmdr5lq35:_shopify messaging\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shopify-messaging?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Messaging</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmdr5lq35:_shopify messaging\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-forms-marketing-consent\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-forms-marketing-consent\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/promoting-marketing/create-marketing/forms-app/settings/all-forms?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#form\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shopify Forms marketing consent</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Decide how you collect marketing consent per form with the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmfr5lq35:_shopify forms\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shopify-forms?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Forms</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmfr5lq35:_shopify forms\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"web-pixels-on-customer-accounts\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"web-pixels-on-customer-accounts\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/web-pixels-load-on-customer-accounts-and-order-status-page?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Web pixels on customer accounts</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Run web pixels and first-party analytics on customer account pages to get more visibility into post-purchase behavior.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"checkout\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"checkout\" data-section-id=\"checkout\" data-section-index=\"5\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-end\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:mt-0 global-lg:mb-[11vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Checkout</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:mt-[19vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Convert customers with personalized checkout experiences and more payment options.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"pt-20 pb-0 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"personalized-shop-pay-button\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"personalized-shop-pay-button\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:562 / 330\" class=\"\"><div data-viewable-component=\"true\" data-component-name=\"rive-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:562 / 330\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block\"><img alt=\"A Buy with Shop button is shown and it expands to include the Mastercard logo and the last for digits of a card.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=100&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=300&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=500&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=700&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=900&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=1100&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=1300&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=1500&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/03cf615f7c023dd5afc16904b8e4b619.png?width=1700&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"block h-full max-h-full max-w-full absolute left-0 top-0 pointer-events-none object-cover\" style=\"width:100%\"/></div></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-personalized-shop-pay-button\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Personalized Shop button</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>The last four digits of a customer’s saved card will appear on their Shop Pay button.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shop.app/en/shop/shop-pay/check-out?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"checkout-and-accounts-customization-per-market\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"checkout-and-accounts-customization-per-market\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"66.66666666666666\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;w