figurations/markets?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shop-pay-installments-in-the-uk\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shop-pay-installments-in-the-uk\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shop-pay-installments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shop Pay Installments in the UK</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Offer Shop Pay&#x27;s Buy Now, Pay Later in the UK with terms up to 24 months.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shop-pay-works-with-global-e\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shop-pay-works-with-global-e\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shop-pay/activating-shop-pay?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#third-party\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shop Pay works with Global-e</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rb2v5mq35:_shop-pay\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/shop-pay?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Pay</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rb2v5mq35:_shop-pay\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> in every market, with domestic orders handled by <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rj2v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Payments</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rj2v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and international orders processed by Global-e.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"apple-pay-in-shop-pay\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"apple-pay-in-shop-pay\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shop-pay/shop-pay?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#supported-payment-methods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Apple Pay in Shop Pay</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Apple Pay is now available as a payment method in <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rb3v5mq35:_shop pay\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/shop-pay?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Pay</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rb3v5mq35:_shop pay\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"reminders-for-shop-pay-subscriptions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"reminders-for-shop-pay-subscriptions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/manage-shop-store/products-and-collections?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#subscriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Reminders for Shop Pay subscriptions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p><span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R74v5mq35:_shop-pay\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/shop-pay?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shop Pay</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R74v5mq35:_shop-pay\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> automatically notifies subscribers before their payment method expires.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"switch-to-shopify-payments-with-zero-downtime\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"switch-to-shopify-payments-with-zero-downtime\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/onboarding/account-setup?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Switch to Shopify Payments with zero downtime</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Move from third-party payment processors to <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rb5v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Payments</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rb5v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> without interrupting checkout.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"streamlined-shopify-payments-onboarding\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"streamlined-shopify-payments-onboarding\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/onboarding?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Streamlined Shopify Payments onboarding</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Set up <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rb6v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Payments</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rb6v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> faster with localized forms, clear guidance, fewer requirements, and help from AI to fill out forms.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"more-payment-methods-in-france\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"more-payment-methods-in-france\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/supported-countries/france/payment-methods?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#local-payment-methods-france\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">More payment methods in France</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Accept cross-border payments in France from Bancontact in Belgium, iDEAL in the Netherlands, Twint in Switzerland, Blik and Przelewy24 in Poland, MobilePay in Denmark, and EPS in Austria.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"klarna-in-more-countries\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"klarna-in-more-countries\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/local-payment-methods/klarna/klarna-shopify-payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#regions-where-merchants-can-use-klarna-with-shopify-payments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Klarna in more countries</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let customers use Klarna on <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rb8v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Payments</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rb8v5mq35:_shopify-payments\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> in Belgium, Denmark, Finland, France, Switzerland, Czechia, Ireland, and Portugal.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"operations\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"operations\" data-section-id=\"operations\" data-section-index=\"6\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-end\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:mt-0 global-lg:mb-[11vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Operations</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:mt-[19vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Improve everyday workflows with flexible inventory modeling and trend-spotting analytics.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"pt-20 pb-0 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-4 space-y-10\" id=\"flexible-inventory-transfers\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"flexible-inventory-transfers\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"51.027777777777786\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 26vw, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 50vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=100&amp;height=51&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=300&amp;height=153&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=500&amp;height=255&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=700&amp;height=357&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=900&amp;height=459&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1100&amp;height=561&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1300&amp;height=663&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1500&amp;height=765&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1700&amp;height=867&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none user-select-none transition-opacity duration-300\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:3600/1837;object-position:center;opacity:0\"/><di