<div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Add shoppable videos to <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5d75oq35:_shop\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shop?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5d75oq35:_shop\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and AI will optimize their distribution with built-in ranking and recommendations.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/manage-shop-store/video?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customizable-shop-product-pages\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customizable-shop-product-pages\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/blog/customize-your-shop-presence?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customizable product pages</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Design your <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5jp5oq35:_shop\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/shop?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5jp5oq35:_shop\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> product pages with custom sections, videos, and branding, then preview how they look before going live.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"better-product-discovery-in-shop-minis\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"better-product-discovery-in-shop-minis\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shop.app/minis/?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#gallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Better product discovery in Shop Minis</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Your products automatically appear in immersive experiences, such as virtual try-on and outfit tracking, for relevant shoppers.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shop-order-tracking-in-18-more-countries\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shop-order-tracking-in-18-more-countries\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shop/delivery-tracking?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Order tracking in 21 more countries</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Shoppers can track purchases in Germany, France, Italy, Spain, New Zealand, Mexico, Switzerland, Denmark, Belgium, Sweden, Norway, Poland, Romania, Portugal, Lithuania, the Czech Republic, the Netherlands, Austria, Finland, Estonia, and Latvia.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"b2b\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"b2b\" data-section-id=\"b2b\" data-section-index=\"8\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pt-[27vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">B2B</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Take your wholesale business global, discover new retailers, and get paid in more ways.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"pt-20 pb-0 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"shopify-collective-available-globally\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-collective-available-globally\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"66.66666666666666\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-