\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shopify-collective/suppliers/discovery?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#find-retailers\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"payment-requests-per-fulfillment\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"payment-requests-per-fulfillment\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"66.66666666666666\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=100&amp;height=67&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=300&amp;height=200&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=500&amp;height=333&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=700&amp;height=467&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=900&amp;height=600&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=1100&amp;height=733&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=1300&amp;height=867&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1000&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/BG-G.png?v=1761951092&amp;width=1700&amp;height=1133&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none user-select-none transition-opacity duration-300\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:3840/2560;object-position:center;opacity:0\"/><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1152\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1152\"><img alt=\"A hat, t-shirt, and skateboard are paired with their payments.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"68.32740213523132\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=100&amp;height=68&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=300&amp;height=205&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=500&amp;height=342&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=700&amp;height=478&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=900&amp;height=615&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=1100&amp;height=752&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=1300&amp;height=888&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U79_Send_payment_requests_per_fulfillment.png?v=1765380307&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1025&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1152\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-payment-requests-per-fulfillment\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Payment requests per fulfillment</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Send a separate payment request for each shipment of a multi-shipment order. Exclusive to Plus.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/managing-orders/payments/deferred-payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#payment-per-fulfillment\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"store-credit-for-b2b\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"store-credit-for-b2b\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/checkout-and-orders/store-credit?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#issue-store-credit-to-a-company-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Store credit for B2B</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Issue store credit to company locations from their location profile or when refunding orders.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"pickup-in-store-for-b2b\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"pickup-in-store-for-b2b\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/checkout-and-orders/shipping-methods?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#pickup-in-store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Pickup in store for B2B</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Let B2B customers select pick up as a delivery option at checkout.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"dynamic-payment-terms-and-deposits\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"dynamic-payment-terms-and-deposits\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/checkout-and-orders/payment-terms?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#configuring-dynamic-payment-terms-and-deposits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Dynamic payment terms and deposits</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use third-party or custom apps powered by Shopify Functions to set dynamic payment terms and deposit requirements. Exclusive to Plus.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"create-rules-for-order-review\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"create-rules-for-order-review\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/checkout-and-orders/draft-orders?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#checkout-to-draft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Create rules for order review</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Set dynamic rules to determine which orders need review based on conditions like order values and products, using apps powered by Shopify Functions. Exclusive to Plus.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"more-b2b-compatible-apps\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"more-b2b-compatible-apps\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/stories/guide-selling-b2b?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">New B2B-compatible apps</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Offer quote requests, custom buyer roles, shopping lists, and more using 11 apps compatible with B2B.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"instant-product-imports-for-retailers\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"instant-product-imports-for-retailers\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shopify-collective/suppliers/price-lists?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#create-price-list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Instant product imports for retailers</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Create public price lists that let retailers import products into their stores without waiting for approval on <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmdr5pq35:_shopify collective\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/collective?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Collective</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmdr5pq35:_shopify collective\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"erp-systems-integration\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"erp-systems-integration\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/b2b/reports-and-automations/external-integrations?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#integrating-to-external-systems-using-direct-integrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">ERP systems integration</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sync companies, orders, and payment terms to NetSuite, BrightPearl, Fulfil, Sage, or Acumatica using pre-built integrations by Patchworks, Fulfil, and Kensium.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"improved-product-import-for-retailers\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"improved-product-import-for-retailers\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/online-sales-channels/shopify-collective/retailers/policies/products?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#default-product-policies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Improved product import for retailers</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Publish imported products to all channels by default on <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmhr5pq35:_shopify collective\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/collective?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Collective</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmhr5pq35:_shopify collective\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-and-edi-workflows-connect\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-and-edi-workflows-connect\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\">Shopify and EDI workflows connect</h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sync EDI purchase orders from <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmjr5pq35:_crstl\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/crstl-b2b-commerce-network?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Crstl</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmjr5pq35:_crstl\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R16jr5pq35:_sps-commerce\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://apps.shopify.com/sps-commerce?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">SPS Commerce</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R16jr5pq35:_sps-commerce\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> directly with your admin as draft orders, using pre-built integrations.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"horizon-themes-work-with-b2b\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"horizon-themes-work-with-b2b\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://themes.shopify.com/collections/horizon-themes?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Horizon themes work with B2B</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>All Horizon themes support built-in volume pricing, quantity rules, and quick order lists.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"finance\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"finance\" data-section-id=\"finance\" data-section-index=\"9\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center\" data-nav-theme=\"dark\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pt-[35vh]\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Finance</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>Modern financial tools designed for growing your business and getting that coin.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"pt-20 pb-0 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"continuous-funding-with-the-shopify-capital-flex-account\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"continuous-funding-with-the-shopify-capital-flex-account\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:522 / 410\" class=\"\"><div data-viewable-component=\"true\" data-component-name=\"rive-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:522 / 410\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block\"><img alt=\"The animation starts with an application for funding, then there&#x27;s a request to withdraw money, and finally the money is withdrawn. \" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=100&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=300&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=500&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=700&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=900&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=1100&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=1300&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=1500&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/1bf084da109bb3fe83016948c3c88b1f.png?width=1700&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"block h-full max-h-full max-w-full absolute left-0 top-0 pointer-events-none object-cover\" style=\"width:100%\"/></div></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-continuous-funding-with-the-shopify-capital-flex-account\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Continuous funding with the Shopify Capital flex account</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Apply once for ongoing access to funding with <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5d35qq35:_shopify-capital\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/capital?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Capital</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5d35qq35:_shopify-capital\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and only pay fees on your outstanding balance. Get replenished funds, subject to approval, as you repay. US only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-capital/shopify-capital-flex?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-3 space-y-10\" id=\"automatic-transfers-in-shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"automatic-transfers-in-shopify-balance\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"51.027777777777786\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=100&amp;height=51&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=300&amp;height=153&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=500&amp;height=255&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=700&amp;height=357&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=900&amp;height=459&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1100&amp;height=561&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1300&amp;height=663&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1500&amp;height=765&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/B4.png?v=1761090303&amp;width=1700&amp;height=867&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none user-select-none transition-opacity duration-300\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:3600/1837;object-position:center;opacity:0\"/><div style=\"aspect-ratio:828 / 981\" class=\"hidden md:block\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:828 / 981\"><img alt=\"An interface shows a breakdown of a payout into sales tax, marketing, inventory, and savings. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"118.4782608695652\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U158_Automated_transfers_for_Shopify_Balance_payouts.png?v=1764976228&amp;width=100&amp;height=118&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U158_Automated_transfers_for_Shopify_Balance_payouts.png?v=1764976228&amp;width=300&amp;height=355&amp;crop=center 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U158_Automated_transfers_for_Shopify_Balance_payouts.png?v=1764976228&amp;width=500&amp;height=592&amp;crop=center 2x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U158_Automated_transfers_for_Shopify_Balance_payouts.png?v=1764976228&amp;width=700&amp;height=829&amp;crop=center 3x\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:828/981\"/></div></div><div style=\"aspect-ratio:981 / 981\" class=\"md:hidden\"></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-automatic-transfers-in-shopify-balance\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Automatic transfers in Shopify Balance</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Set rules in <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5d55qq35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/balance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5d55qq35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> to automatically split each payout across accounts, such as expenses, inventory, marketing, and savings. US only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/manual/finance/shopify-balance/managing-account/transfers?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#shopify-balance-automatic-transfers\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 md:col-span-3 sm-tablet:col-span-2 space-y-10\" id=\"staff-cards-spend-controls-with-shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"staff-cards-spend-controls-with-shopify-balance\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"69.6798493408663\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=100&amp;height=70&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=300&amp;height=209&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=500&amp;height=348&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=700&amp;height=488&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=900&amp;height=627&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=1100&amp;height=766&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=1300&amp;height=906&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1045&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/Rectangle_240657548.jpg?v=1760629924&amp;width=1700&amp;height=1185&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none user-select-none transition-opacity duration-300\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:2124/1480;object-position:left;opacity:0\"/><div style=\"aspect-ratio:828 / 1272\" class=\"hidden md:block\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:828 / 1272\"><img alt=\"A credit card is shown with an interface that breaks down the staff cards by department. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"153.62318840579712\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 20vw, (min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U163_Spend_controls_secondary_cardholders_for_Balance.png?v=1762888832&amp;width=100&amp;height=154&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U163_Spend_controls_secondary_cardholders_for_Balance.png?v=1762888832&amp;width=300&amp;height=461&amp;crop=center 1x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U163_Spend_controls_secondary_cardholders_for_Balance.png?v=1762888832&amp;width=500&amp;height=768&amp;crop=center 2x, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U163_Spend_controls_secondary_cardholders_for_Balance.png?v=1762888832&amp;width=700&amp;height=1075&amp;crop=center 3x\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:828/1272\"/></div></div><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1203 / 1203\" class=\"md:hidden\"></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-staff-cards-spend-controls-with-shopify-balance\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Staff cards with spend controls</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Issue <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5d75qq35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/balance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5d75qq35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> cards to staff and set spend controls. US only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-balance/cards/card?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#number-of-cards\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-capital-in-more-european-countries\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-capital-in-more-european-countries\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-capital?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shopify Capital in more European countries</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Access fast funding with adjustable repayment terms in the Netherlands, Spain, and Ireland with <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rm3p5qq35:_shopify capital\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/capital?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Capital</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rm3p5qq35:_shopify capital\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"track-international-profit-margins\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"track-international-profit-margins\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/reports-and-analytics/shopify-reports/report-types/default-reports/profit-reports?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#average-profit-margin-by-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Track international profit margins</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Compare actual and estimated costs by market, including duties, taxes, and shipping adjustments.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"credits-on-usdc-transactions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"credits-on-usdc-transactions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/payments/shopify-payments/usdc-payments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#credits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Credits on USDC transactions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Earn automatic credits on every order paid with USDC, which appear in your order timeline and payouts—paid in fiat or USDC on settlement. US, Mexico, and Hong Kong only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"same-day-ach-transfers-with-shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"same-day-ach-transfers-with-shopify-balance\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-balance/managing-account/transfers?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#shopify-balance-transfer-to-bank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Same-day ACH transfers</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Send money from your <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rm9p5qq35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/balance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rm9p5qq35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> account by 1pm ET to have transfers arrive the same business day. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"unified-card-dispute-for-shopify-balance-and-credit\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"unified-card-dispute-for-shopify-balance-and-credit\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\">Unified card dispute</h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>File and track disputes directly from both <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmbp5qq35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-balance/managing-account/disputes/dispute-card-transactions?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#disputing-charges-on-your-shopify-balance-account\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmbp5qq35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Read help doc\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Read help doc&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R16bp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-credit/disputes?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#disputing-charges-on-your-shopify-credit-account\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Credit</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R16bp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Read help doc\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Read help doc&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> transactions lists in a clear, self-serve flow. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"increased-shopify-credit-rewards-cap\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"increased-shopify-credit-rewards-cap\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-credit/rewards?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#calculating-your-cashback-rewards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Increased Shopify Credit rewards cap</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Earn 3% cashback on up to $250,000 in eligible purchases on your top spend category annually, and 1% after with Shopify Credit. Earn 1% for all other eligible categories. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"dynamic-credit-limits-with-shopify-credit\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"dynamic-credit-limits-with-shopify-credit\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-credit/manage-account?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#credit-limit-changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Dynamic credit limits</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get access to a credit limit that automatically adjusts based on your sales, utilization, and repayments with <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmfp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/credit?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Credit</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmfp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"add-checks-in-shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"add-checks-in-shopify-balance\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/manual/finance/shopify-balance/adding-checks?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Add checks in Shopify Balance</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Add checks directly to your Shopify Balance account using the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmhp5qq35:_shopify-mobile\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/mobile?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify mobile</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmhp5qq35:_shopify-mobile\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Get app\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Get app&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> app with no fees. US only.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"real-time-fraud-alerts-for-shopify-cards\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"real-time-fraud-alerts-for-shopify-cards\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/finance/shopify-credit/card-security?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#fraud-alerts-on-shopify-credit-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Real‑time fraud alerts for Shopify cards</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get SMS fraud alerts for suspicious activity on <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rmjp5qq35:_shopify-balance\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/balance?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Balance</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rmjp5qq35:_shopify-balance\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R16jp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/credit?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Credit</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R16jp5qq35:_shopify-credit\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>. US only.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-light\" id=\"shipping\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"shipping\" data-section-id=\"shipping\" data-section-index=\"10\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block glob