mp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U117_FedEx_One_Rate_Return_Labels_6-col.png?v=1765246018&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1105&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1242\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-fedex-return-labels\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">FedEx return labels</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Create, send, and track FedEx return labels in the Shopify admin with discounted pay‑on‑scan rates. US only.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/fulfilling-orders/shipping-labels/buying-labels/return-labels?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#supported-shipping-carriers\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColo