-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1242\"><img alt=\"The shipping interface shows the default packaging options for each product. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"73.66548042704626\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=100&amp;height=74&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=300&amp;height=221&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=500&amp;height=368&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=700&amp;height=516&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=900&amp;height=663&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=1100&amp;height=810&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=1300&amp;height=958&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U122_Variant_default_packaging.png?v=1765168583&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1105&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1242\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-default-package-per-variant\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Default package per variant</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Set a default package for each variant to get more accurate shipping rates at checkout and buy labels faster for single‑item orders.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/setup/packaging/setting-up-packages?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#package-per-variant\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read help doc</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed bg-grey-light py-40 lg:py-60 \"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-repeat\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/texture-src-90.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-1 opacity-0\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"custom-sender-name-on-labels\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"custom-sender-name-on-labels\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/fulfilling-orders/shipping-labels/managing-labels/printing-shipping-documents?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#custom-name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Custom sender name on labels</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Choose the sender name that appears on your shipping labels to protect privacy, satisfy legal requirements, and keep gifts discreet.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"more-logistics-partners\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"more-logistics-partners\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/shopify-fulfillment-network/logistics-partners?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">More logistics partners</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Choose from more third‑party fulfillment partners, including Amazon, Bigblue, DHL, GoBolt, and Mayple, and track performance in the <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R5iv5rq35:_shopify-fulfillment network\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/fulfillment?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Shopify Fulfillment Network</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R5iv5rq35:_shopify-fulfillment network\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span>.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"expanded-us-and-canada-cross-border-labels\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"expanded-us-and-canada-cross-border-labels\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/fulfilling-orders/shipping-labels/buying-labels/ddp-ddu?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Expanded US and Canada cross-border labels</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Buy DHL Express Delivered Duty Paid (DDP) or Delivered Duty Unpaid (DDU) and Canada Post DDP labels in Canada, and buy DHL eCommerce DDU labels in the US—directly in the admin.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"more-global-shipping-carriers\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"more-global-shipping-carriers\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/fulfilling-orders/shipping-labels/shipping-carriers?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">More global shipping carriers</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Buy shipping labels directly in the admin for Royal Mail in the UK, Australia Post in Australia, and DHL Express in Canada.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"in-progress-fulfillment-status\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"in-progress-fulfillment-status\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/fulfillment/fulfilling-orders/single-fulfillment?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#in-progress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">In-progress fulfillment status</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Mark orders as in progress, add timeline notes, run bulk actions, and manage statuses in a redesigned fulfillment card.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-clip flex justify-end pointer-events-none text-dark\" id=\"developer\" data-component-extra-section-handle=\"developer\" data-section-id=\"developer\" data-section-index=\"11\"><div class=\"relative w-full global-lg:w-4/5\"><div class=\"safe-min-h-70-svh md:safe-min-h-140-svh flex flex-col px-12 md:px-70 global-lg:px-0 justify-end md:justify-center global-lg:block global-lg:place-content-center\" data-nav-theme=\"light\"><h2 class=\"md:grow headline-1 flex flex-col py-40 md:py-130 justify-center transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 global-lg:pt-[20vh] global-lg:pb-0\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none\">Developer</span></h2><div class=\"lg:w-9/12 mb-70 lg:mb-40 pointer-events-auto global-lg:pt-[11vh]\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><div class=\"rich-text narrative-1 drop-cap\"><p>A completely new way to build for commerce with the power of AI.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-light text-black pointer-events-auto\" data-nav-style=\"solid\" data-nav-theme=\"light\"><div id=\"agentic-commerce\"><div class=\"pt-20 pb-60 lg:pb-80 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><h3 class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 headline-3 mt-22 headline-4\">Agentic Commerce</h3><article class=\"w-full col-span-full global-lg:mb-40 grid grid-cols-subgrid items-center px-0\" id=\"build-commerce-agents-from-the-dev-dash\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"build-commerce-agents-from-the-dev-dash\"><div class=\"col-span-full global-lg:col-span-4\"><h4 id=\"card-heading-build-commerce-agents-from-the-dev-dash\" class=\"mb-15 headline-4 text-dark\">Build commerce agents</h4><div class=\"rich-text mb-15 text-pretty text-dark narrative-3\"><p>Bring native shopping into AI conversations with access to the Shopify Catalog API and Checkout MCP, all from the new Dev Dash.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/agents?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read dev docs</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"media-wrapper relative max-w-full col-span-full global-lg:col-span-8\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:752 / 600\" class=\"\"><div data-viewable-component=\"true\" data-component-name=\"rive-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:752 / 600\"><div class=\"relative transition-opacity duration-300 w-full max-w-full opacity-100\" style=\"aspect-ratio:752 / 600\"></div></div></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"shopify-catalog-for-all\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-catalog-for-all\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1124 / 962\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1124 / 962\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"85.58718861209965\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=100&amp;height=86&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=300&amp;height=257&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=500&amp;height=428&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=700&amp;height=599&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=900&amp;height=770&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U271_Checkout_MCP.png?v=1764963709&amp;width=1100&amp;height=941&amp;crop=center 1100w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1124/962\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-shopify-catalog-for-all\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Shopify Catalog for all</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Search billions of products across Shopify merchants using MCP tools or REST—and soon, select partners can access a direct catalog feed.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/agents/catalog?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read dev docs</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 md:col-span-6 sm-tablet:col-span-2 space-y-10\" id=\"checkout-kit-for-web\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"checkout-kit-for-web\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1443\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1443\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"85.58718861209965\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=100&amp;height=86&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=300&amp;height=257&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=500&amp;height=428&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=700&amp;height=599&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=900&amp;height=770&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=1100&amp;height=941&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=1300&amp;height=1113&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U183_Checkout_for_web_f222b0b3-24d2-4ee2-aff2-ebf8ffb4a766.png?v=1765120160&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1284&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1443\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-checkout-kit-for-web\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Checkout Kit for web</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Bring a merchant’s checkout to any agentic flow in a browser with a JS library that renders in a pop-up or a new tab—also available in Swift, Android, and React Native.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"http://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/mobile/checkout-kit/web?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read dev docs</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article></div></div><div id=\"developer-sidekick\"><div class=\"pt-4 pb-60 lg:pb-80 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><h3 class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 headline-3 headline-4\">Sidekick</h3><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"sidekick-recommends-apps\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-recommends-apps\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1284\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1284\"><img alt=\"A Sidekick prompt where the user asked about review apps and received recommendations. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"76.15658362989323\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=100&amp;height=76&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=300&amp;height=228&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=500&amp;height=381&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=700&amp;height=533&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=900&amp;height=685&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=1100&amp;height=838&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=1300&amp;height=990&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U226__Sidekick_app_discovery_6b57593c-579c-4a91-84af-7173ff60da83.png?v=1764892648&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1142&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1284\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-sidekick-recommends-apps\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Sidekick recommends apps</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Merchants can find and install apps directly in Sidekick, with <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rlkp9sq35:_built-for-shopify\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/built-for-shopify?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Built for Shopify</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rlkp9sq35:_built-for-shopify\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Learn more\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Learn more&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> apps receiving higher prioritization and clear badges.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/app-recommendations-in-sidekick-now-available?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Learn more</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"sidekick-app-extensions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"sidekick-app-extensions\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspe