se\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1269\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-admin-intents-api\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Seamless workflows with the Admin Intents API</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Launch admin workflows for creating, editing, and managing Shopify resources with a single line of code.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://www.shopify.com/partners/blog/introducing-admin-intents-keep-merchants-in-your-app-while-managing-shopify-resources?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read article</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"faster-bulk-operations\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"faster-bulk-operations\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1563\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1563\"><img alt=\"Multiple code editors where the developer is running a bulk import. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"92.70462633451957\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=100&amp;height=93&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=300&amp;height=278&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=500&amp;height=464&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=700&amp;height=649&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=900&amp;height=834&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=1100&amp;height=1020&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=1300&amp;height=1205&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U191_Faster_bulk_data_imports.png?v=1764969366&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1391&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1563\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-faster-bulk-operations\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Faster bulk operations</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Shopify&#x27;s bulk operations API now supports all Admin API mutations, accepts 100MB files, and runs up to five concurrent operations.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/usage/bulk-operations/imports?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read dev docs</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"improved-metafields-and-metaobjects\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"improved-metafields-and-metaobjects\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1191\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1191\"><img alt=\"A code editor is paired with a search bar where the user searched for a date. \" decoding=\"async\" height=\"70.64056939501779\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=100&amp;height=71&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=300&amp;height=212&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=500&amp;height=353&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=700&amp;height=494&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=900&amp;height=636&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=1100&amp;height=777&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=1300&amp;height=918&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U223_upgrades_for_metafields.png?v=1765245773&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1060&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1191\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-improved-metafields-and-metaobjects\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Improved metafields and metaobjects</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p><span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:Rraa9sq35:_metafields\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/metafields/about-metafields?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">Metafields</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:Rraa9sq35:_metafields\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Read dev docs\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Read dev docs&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> and <span class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"relative peer\" aria-describedby=\"tooltipID_:R1raa9sq35:_metaobjects\" data-component-name=\"cta-inline-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/metaobjects/about-metaobjects?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\">metaobjects</a><span id=\"tooltipID_:R1raa9sq35:_metaobjects\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"Read dev docs\" style=\"--tooltip-content:&quot;Read dev docs&quot;\" class=\"hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 peer-focus:opacity-100 md:inline-block tooltip\"></span></span> render faster on storefronts, support richer query filtering, allow higher entry limits, and more.</p></div></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"tangle\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"tangle\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1437\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1437\"><img alt=\"A visual editor is shown where the user is training ML collaboratively.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"85.23131672597866\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=100&amp;height=85&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=300&amp;height=256&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=500&amp;height=426&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=700&amp;height=597&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=900&amp;height=767&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=1100&amp;height=938&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=1300&amp;height=1108&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U267_Tangle.png?v=1764976717&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1278&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1437\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-tangle\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Introducing Tangle</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Build ML and data pipelines collaboratively with an open-source experimentation platform that comes with a powerful visual editor.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://tangleml.com/?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Learn more</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"binary-testing-in-shopify-functions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"binary-testing-in-shopify-functions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/functions/test-debug-functions?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Binary testing in Shopify Functions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build tests from real production data and catch breaking changes before they hit production when you migrate from JavaScript to Rust.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-dev-mcp-supports-hydrogen-and-shopify-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-dev-mcp-supports-hydrogen-and-shopify-api\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://hydrogen.shopify.dev/update/december-2025?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shopify Dev MCP supports Hydrogen and Shopify API</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Access documentation for Hydrogen and Storefront API in the Dev MCP to build headless Shopify stores with AI coding tools such as Cursor or Claude Code.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"liquid-support-in-shopify-dev-mcp\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"liquid-support-in-shopify-dev-mcp\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/devmcp?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#enable-liquid-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Liquid support in Shopify Dev MCP</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Validate Liquid code in Shopify Dev MCP to catch errors before deployment.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-dev-mcp-supports-pos-ui-extensions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-dev-mcp-supports-pos-ui-extensions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/dev-mcp-now-supports-pos-ui-extensions?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shopify Dev MCP supports POS UI extensions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build POS UI extensions faster with AI using Shopify Dev MCP, which pulls right from the POS dev docs, generates valid code, and cuts errors.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopify-functions-replace-scripts-in-2026\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopify-functions-replace-scripts-in-2026\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/functions/migrating-from-shopify-scripts?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Shopify Functions replace Scripts in 2026</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>In June 2026, Shopify Functions will replace Scripts with faster execution and increased parity for a safer migration.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"dev-assistant-supports-all-of-shopify\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"dev-assistant-supports-all-of-shopify\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Dev Assistant supports all of Shopify</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get access to the full developer platform with the upgraded Dev Assistant, which surfaces targeted documentation and code examples based on what you&#x27;re trying to build.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"enhanced-security-with-token-expiry\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"enhanced-security-with-token-expiry\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/authentication-authorization/access-tokens/offline-access-tokens?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Enhanced security with token expiry</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use expiring tokens to make your app more secure with OAuth 2.0-compliant token refresh, including programmatic exchange for existing non-expiring tokens.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"enhanced-dev-console\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"enhanced-dev-console\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/cli-for-apps/test-apps-locally?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Enhanced Dev Console</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Clean up dev previews, uninstall apps, and open the Dev Dashboard directly from the console.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"multi-environment-theme-commands\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"multi-environment-theme-commands\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/tools/cli/environments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Multi-environment theme commands</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Execute theme commands in the CLI for multiple environments simultaneously, enabling bulk operations across different stores.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"polaris-unified-ui-components-expand-to-pos\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"polaris-unified-ui-components-expand-to-pos\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/pos-ui-extensions/2025-10-rc/polaris-web-components?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Polaris unified UI components expand to POS</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build POS extensions with Polaris web components using a standardized, web-component-based UI system.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"discount-code-rejection-with-shopify-functions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"discount-code-rejection-with-shopify-functions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/discounts/discount-rejections?extension=rust&amp;utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Discount code rejection with Shopify Functions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use Shopify Functions to reject discount codes and include an associated custom message displayed at checkout.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"storefronts-extensions\"><div class=\"pt-4 contain-intrinsic-size-auto-screen grid-template-with-gaps grid-padding pb-64\" data-nav-style=\"solid\"><h3 class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 headline-3 headline-4\">Storefronts + Extensions</h3><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"shop-minis-sdk\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shop-minis-sdk\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:562 / 451\" class=\"\"><div data-viewable-component=\"true\" data-component-name=\"rive-container\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:562 / 451\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=100&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=300&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=500&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=700&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=900&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=1100&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=1300&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=1500&amp;crop=center 1500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/b/shopify-brochure2-assets/c9c913c72ba45ce34cb2521bcaaefd07.png?width=1700&amp;crop=center 1700w\" width=\"100\" class=\"block h-full max-h-full max-w-full absolute left-0 top-0 pointer-events-none object-cover\" style=\"width:100%\"/></div></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-shop-minis-sdk\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">Shop Minis SDK</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Build Shop Minis to create immersive shopping experiences, such as virtual try-on and live shopping, and distribute them directly to Shop app users.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shop.app/minis?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Learn more</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><article class=\"card-container col-span-2 sm-tablet:col-span-1 md:col-span-6 space-y-10\" id=\"pos-extensions-storage-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"pos-extensions-storage-api\"><div class=\"media-wrapper relative\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1701\" class=\"\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-full animate-show-media\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1686 / 1701\"><img alt=\"A code editor shows the developer using the POS Extensions Storage API.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"100.88967971530249\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(min-width: 940px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=100&amp;height=101&amp;crop=center\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=300&amp;height=303&amp;crop=center 300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=500&amp;height=504&amp;crop=center 500w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=700&amp;height=706&amp;crop=center 700w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=900&amp;height=908&amp;crop=center 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=1100&amp;height=1110&amp;crop=center 1100w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=1300&amp;height=1312&amp;crop=center 1300w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0951/3130/4218/files/U190_pos_extension_storage_dark.png?v=1763597323&amp;width=1500&amp;height=1513&amp;crop=center 1500w\" width=\"100\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 size-full block object-cover\" draggable=\"false\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:1686/1701\"/></div></div></div><div><h3 id=\"card-heading-pos-extensions-storage-api\" class=\"mb-10 card-content-width bodycopy-1\">POS Extensions Storage API</h3><div class=\"card-content-width\"><div class=\"rich-text mb-10 text-grey-dark bodycopy-1\"><p>Reduce API calls and improve performance with persistent, namespaced storage inside the POS app.</p></div><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-colors outline-none ring-focus ring-offset-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:ring-1 gap-5 py-3 rounded-3 bg-light border-1 border-grey-light min-h-[26px] md:min-h-21 active:bg-dark active:border-dark hover:bg-grey-light disabled:opacity-50 disabled:active:bg-light disabled:active:border-grey-light disabled:focus-visible:bg-light disabled:hover:bg-light pl-5 pr-3 pointer-events-auto no-underline!\" data-component-name=\"cta-link\" href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/pos-ui-extensions/latest/apis/storage-api?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\"><span class=\"bodycopy-2 text-dark text-left transition-colors group-active:text-light group-disabled:active:text-dark\">Read dev docs</span><div class=\"block place-content-center place-items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:mx-auto rounded-xs size-13 transition-colors shrink-0 mt-[1px] md:mt-0 bg-light border-1 border-inherit text-dark group-active:border-light [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-7\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 7 7\" aria-label=\"Opens a new window\" role=\"img\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m5.105 5.112-.078-2.397-3.599 3.599-.75-.75 3.6-3.599-2.397-.078v-.99l4.058.156.163 4.066-.997-.007Z\"></path></svg></div></a></div></div></article><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-12 relative px-grid-spacing md:px-grid-spacing-md full-bleed\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-grid-spacing md:gap-x-grid-spacing-md gap-y-30 relative\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"unlisted-product-status-value\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"unlisted-product-status-value\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/2025-10/enums/ProductStatus?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#enums-UNLISTED\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Unlisted product status value</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build support for the unlisted product status to hide products from search results, collections, and more, while keeping them accessible with a direct URL.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"combine-bundle-options-with-the-admin-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"combine-bundle-options-with-the-admin-api\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/product-merchandising/bundles/add-product-fixed-bundle?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Combine bundle options with the Admin API</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use the Admin API to let merchants combine bundle options, such as size and length, into one selection.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"due-on-fulfillment-terms-for-pre-orders\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"due-on-fulfillment-terms-for-pre-orders\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/purchase-options/deferred?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#orders-with-multiple-due-dates-and-deposits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Due on fulfillment terms for pre-orders</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Pre-order apps support customers paying a deposit at checkout and the remaining balance when the order is fulfilled.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"new-code-editor-for-themes\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"new-code-editor-for-themes\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/tools/shopify-liquid-vscode?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">New code editor for themes</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Get Liquid code editing with multi-file search, syntax highlighting, intelligent autocomplete, keyboard shortcuts, side-by-side version diffs, and more.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"storefront-mcp-works-with-hydrogen-stores\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"storefront-mcp-works-with-hydrogen-stores\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://hydrogen.shopify.dev/update/december-2025?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Storefront MCP works with Hydrogen stores</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use Storefront MCP with Hydrogen to build agents that can tailor recommendations, assist with cart building, and hand off to checkout.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"ai-discovery-for-headless-stores\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"ai-discovery-for-headless-stores\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://hydrogen.shopify.dev/update/december-2025?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">AI discovery for headless stores</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Headless stores are discoverable in AI chats like ChatGPT and Perplexity by automatically being part of the Shopify Catalog.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"nested-cart-lines\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"nested-cart-lines\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/product-merchandising/nested-cart-lines?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Nested cart lines</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build support for merchants to nest cart lines in cart, checkout, and post-purchase views for product add-ons, such as extended warranties.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"native-wallet-buttons-before-checkout\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"native-wallet-buttons-before-checkout\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/mobile/checkout-kit/accelerated-checkouts-overview?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Native wallet buttons before checkout</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Add Shop Pay and Apple Pay wallet buttons on PDP and Cart pages in mobile apps using the Checkout Kit.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"discount-eligibility-context-field\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"discount-eligibility-context-field\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/2025-10/unions/DiscountContext?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Discount eligibility context field</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Natively support targeted automatic discounts for customer segments, like VIP, without needing Shopify Scripts.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"payment-requirement-removed-on-subscriptions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"payment-requirement-removed-on-subscriptions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/purchase-options/subscriptions/migrate-to-subscriptions-api/migrate-subscription-contracts?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Payment requirement removed on subscriptions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Import existing subscribers via API, even if their payment method is missing or expired—just collect or update the details later.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"pos-ui-extensions-for-cart-line-items\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"pos-ui-extensions-for-cart-line-items\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/pos-ui-extensions/latest/targets/action/pos-cart-line-item-details-action-render?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">POS UI extensions for cart line items</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Add contextual actions to an individual POS cart line item, such as dynamic bundles.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"variant-customization-on-pos\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"variant-customization-on-pos\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://help.shopify.com/en/manual/sell-in-person/shopify-pos/process-sales-transaction?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#add-an-item-to-the-cart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Variant customization on POS</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Sell customizable products in person by adding the same variant to the cart with different configurations, which you can see split into distinct lines.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"more-pos-ui-extension-tools\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"more-pos-ui-extension-tools\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/pos-ui-extensions-developer-experience-improvements?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">More POS UI extension tools</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build POS UI extensions faster with stable hot reloading, clear in-app build errors, QR deep links, and a new in-app dev console.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"pos-ui-extensions-open-native-screens\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"pos-ui-extensions-open-native-screens\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/pos-ui-extensions/latest/target-apis/platform-apis/navigation-api?example=example-navigate-to-a-native-pos-screen&amp;utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">POS UI extensions open native screens</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Open native POS products, orders, customers, draft orders, and staff details in modals that respect staff permissions right in UI extensions.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"cart-transform-function-api-on-pos\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"cart-transform-function-api-on-pos\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/functions/latest/cart-transform?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Cart Transform Function API on POS</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use this API to let the POS dynamically expand, merge, or update cart lines for bundles, custom pricing, and rich cart customization.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customize-subscriptions-with-pos-ui-extensions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customize-subscriptions-with-pos-ui-extensions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/subscription-selling-plan-support-with-pos-ui-extensions?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customize subscriptions with POS UI Extensions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Add and manage subscriptions with detailed line item data using the Cart APIs in POS UI Extensions 2025-10.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"transfers-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"transfers-api\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/mutations/inventorytransfercreate?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Transfers API</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Model real-world transfers, including those from locations not tracked in Shopify, with the Transfers API.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"return-apis-with-payment-reference\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"return-apis-with-payment-reference\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/queries/return?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Return APIs with payment reference</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Simplify reconciliation for returns through a direct reference to the transaction with the Return API.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"customer-account-api-supports-third-party-apps\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"customer-account-api-supports-third-party-apps\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/headless/building-with-the-customer-account-api/authenticate-customers?extension=javascript&amp;utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Customer Account API supports third-party apps</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use Shopify customer authentication to give customers a unified sign-in experience and securely access customer data.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"store-credit-refunds-in-returns-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"store-credit-refunds-in-returns-api\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/admin-graphql/latest/objects/SuggestedStoreCreditRefund?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Store credit refunds in returns API</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Refund to store credit through the return and order cancellation APIs, even when store credit was not the original payment method.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"shopifyql-api-for-shopify-analytics\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"shopifyql-api-for-shopify-analytics\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/shopifyql?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">ShopifyQL API for Shopify Analytics</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Build analytics features faster by querying thousands of combinations of Shopify Analytics metrics and dimensions.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"returns-processing-api\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"returns-processing-api\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/returns-apps/migrate-to-return-processing?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Returns processing API</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Control when return sales are recorded in Shopify using a new processing mutation.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"improved-onboarding-flows-with-app-bridge\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"improved-onboarding-flows-with-app-bridge\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/app-bridge-library/apis/app?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Improved onboarding flows with App Bridge</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use shopify.app.extensions() to check which of your checkout and customer account extensions are active.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"inventory-adjustments-reference\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"inventory-adjustments-reference\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/changelog/new-guidelines-for-referencedocumenturi-in-inventory-adjustments?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Inventory adjustments reference</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Add referenceDocumentUri to adjustments to show your app in admin history, create audit‑ready trails, and trace changes to its source.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"payment-terms-and-deposit-configurations\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"payment-terms-and-deposit-configurations\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/functions/latest/payment-customization?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#CartPaymentMethodsTransformRunResult.fields.operations.paymentTermsSet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Payment terms and deposit configurations</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Use the paymentTermsSet operation in Shopify Payment Customization Functions to dynamically change payment terms and deposit requirements. Exclusive to Plus.</p></div></div></article></div><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5 md:even:col-start-7\"><article id=\"order-review-operation-in-shopify-functions\" data-component-name=\"product\" data-component-extra-handle=\"order-review-operation-in-shopify-functions\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-x-grid-spacing-md\"><h3 class=\"bodycopy-1 font-bold lg:col-span-2\"><a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/api/functions/latest/payment-customization?utm_source=w26-editions-website&amp;utm_medium=product-cta&amp;utm_campaign=winter26edition#CartPaymentMethodsTransformRunResult.fields.operations.orderReviewAdd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"list-title-link no-underline hover:underline\" data-component-name=\"cta-title-link\">Order review operation in Shopify Functions</a></h3><div class=\"rich-text bodycopy-1 text-grey-mid lg:col-span-3\"><p>Determine which B2B orders require review based on specific conditions using the orderReviewAdd operation in payment customization. Exclusive to Plus.</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full flex justify-center\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute left-2 bottom-2 translate-y-[calc(100%+2px)] z-50 px-16 py-8 rounded-8 bg-dark text-light border-none cursor-pointer bodycopy-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-transform duration-200 ease-out focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-ring pointer-events-none focus-visible:pointer-events-auto\">Back to navigation</button></div></div></section></div></main></div><div role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"signup-modal-heading\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"fixed left-0 bottom-0 w-full h-full bg-black/90 flex items-cen