1+-+Core+Product+SEO%3A%0A-+Product+title%3A+Make+it+clear%2C+keyword-rich%2C+and+benefit-driven%0A-+SEO+title%3A+60+characters+max%0A-+Meta+description%3A+155+characters%2C+compelling+and+conversion-focused%0A-+Product+description%3A+200-300+words%2C+benefit-driven%2C+scannable+format+with+bullets%0A-+Product+type+and+category%3A+Set+the+most+accurate+classification%0A%0AStage+2+-+Category+Metafields%3A%0A-+Review+and+fill+all+available+category+metafields+%28material%2C+color%2C+size%2C+target+audience%2C+etc.%29%0A-+Only+populate+fields+that+are+relevant+to+this+specific+product%0A%0AStage+3+-+Image+Alt+Text%3A%0A-+Update+alt+text+for+each+product+image%0A-+Keep+under+125+characters+per+image%0A-+Include+product+name+and+key+features+in+each%0A%0AUse+my+existing+product+information+as+the+foundation%2C+but+make+everything+search-friendly+and+conversion-focused.+Show+me+what+you%27ll+change+before+applying+it.\\\",{\\\"_692\\\":6856,\\\"_6848\\\":6856,\\\"_695\\\":6857,\\\"_153\\\":6858},\\\"monthly-snapshot\\\",\\\"Analyze my store's performance for the last 30 days.\\\",\\\"https://admin.shopify.com/sidekick?sk_s=monthly-snapshot\\u0026sk_p=Analyze+my+store%27s+performance+for+the+last+30+days+and+compare+it+to+the+previous+30+days.+%0A%0AShow+me%3A%0A%0A1.+Revenue+Metrics%3A%0A+++-+Total+sales%2C+orders%2C+and+AOV+%28with+%25+change+vs+previous+period%29%0A+++-+Breakdown+by+sales+channel+%28Online+Store%2C+POS%2C+etc.%29%0A+++%0A2.+Top+Performers%3A%0A+++-+Top+10+products+by+revenue+with+quantities+sold%0A+++-+Top+5+products+by+units+sold+%28if+different+from+revenue+leaders%29%0A+++-+Best+performing+collection+by+total+sales%0A+++%0A3.+Customer+Insights%3A%0A+++-+New+vs+returning+customer+split+%28count+and+revenue%29%0A+++-+Total+unique+customers+who+purchased%0A+++-+Average+time+between+first+and+second+purchase+%28for+repeat+buyers%29%0A+++%0A4.+Conversion+%26+Traffic%3A%0A+++-+Conversion+rate+with+sessions+and+add-to-carts%0A+++-+Top+3+traffic+sources%0A++